2 CONT
2 CONT [http://www.st-andrews.ac.uk/history/ssne/item.php?id=2018&id2=2018 Constantine Campbell] in Scotland, Scandinavia and Northern European Biographical Database,  (University of St. Andrews), accessed May 22, 2013.
