1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===LUDVIG HAMILTON af Dalserf (aka LEWIS HAMILTON)===
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Svensk Friherre till Monea. Naturaliseret i Sverige 1648===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Ludvig Hamilton (aka Lewis Hamilton) is the fifth and youngest son of Malcom Hamilton, Archbishop of Cashel. His mother was Jane Crawford, who was still alive when his father made his last will and testament on 27 August 1627. 
2 CONC This is proved by the following extract from his father's will: "Providing also that Malcolme, my sonne, shall pay unto Marye Hamilton, my second daughter, £200 ster. lawful money of and in England, within two years of her marriag
2 CONC e. Providing also that Malcolme Hamilton shall pay unto Agnes Hamilton, my third daughter, £100 ster. of the like money within two years after her marriage. Proving also that Malcolm Hamilton, my sonne, shall pay unto Lewis Hamilt
2 CONC on, my youngest sonne, £100 ster. of the like money when he shall come to eighteen years of age. My will is that their mother shall keep them all at scole, and give them meate and drink and clothes fitting for them; and in case th
2 CONC at their mother shall depart this natural lyfe, that Malcolm Hamilton, my son, shall give them meate and drink and clothes, and keep them all at scole, without diminishing any of their moneyes above written". [https://archive.org/
2 CONC stream/ulsterjournalar08unkngoog#page/n212/mode/1up Ulster Journal of Archaeology, Volume I, pp. 198-99]
1 FAMS @F6000000004301386762@
1 RFN geni:6000000004301468938
