1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Anna Enander''' was born in 1615. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-76803359 Kyrkoherde Nicolaus Petri Enander] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-65934747 Elin Helena Johansdotter]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna married [https://www.geni.com/profile-35169889 Daniel Laurentii Daalhemius] in 1632. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-123586254 Maria Daalhemia]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-118870385 
2 CONC Helena Daalhemia]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34665236072 Rebecca Daalhemia]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna married [https://www.geni.com/profile-76326805 Lars Nilsson Palumbus] in 1659. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on February 29, 1668 in Vreta klosters sn, (E), Sweden. 
2 CONT ----
