2 CONT * 24.02.1690 Riksregistraturet, SE/RA/1112.1/B/529 (1690) Quartermaster Johan von Stauden https://sok.riksarkivet.se/bildvisning/A0039024_00587#?xywh=846%2C187%2C5895%2C2685&cv=586 pages 597-598; Titularregister till riksregistrat
2 CONC uret, Titularregister till riksregistraturet, SE/RA/1112.2/16 (1687-1690) https://sok.riksarkivet.se/bildvisning/A0039207_00011#?xywh=1351%2C561%2C4646%2C2326&cv=10 bild 11
