2 CONT
2 CONT * http://books.google.com/books?id=ZSAwAAAAMAAJ&pg=PA3&lpg=PA3&dq=Karin+M%C3%A5nsdotter&source=web&ots=ve2bKVbwBG&sig=LhyUoCDYg7I6Hy0JUQitPu6JSwc#v=onepage&q&f=false
2 CONT
