1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Per Jönsson''' was born circa 1548 in Sweden. He was a bonde (farmer). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Per married [https://www.geni.com/profile-86912310 Lisa Persdotter]. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-76803359 Kyrkoherde Nicolaus Petri Enander]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in Sticklösa, Jönköping (F), Sweden. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Per var bonde i Sticklösa by i Skärstads socken i Jönköpings län.
2 CONT
2 CONT Per Joensson blev gemensam stamfader för de adliga ätterna:
2 CONT > English: Per Joensson became the common ancestor of the noble families:
2 CONT
2 CONT * Gyllenadler (ätt nr 655),
2 CONT * Enefelt (ätt nr 671),
2 CONT * Enhielm (ätt nr 1275), 
2 CONT * Silfverstråle (ätt nr 1372), och
2 CONT * Enanderhielm (ätt nr 1484).
2 CONT
2 CONT == Sources ==
2 CONT
