1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Helena Daalhemia''' Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-35169889 Daniel Laurentii Daalhemius] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-76326825 Anna Enander]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Helena married [https://www.geni.com/profile-118870361 Sven Nicolai Cnattingius] in 1663. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-123586666 Daniel Svenonis Cnattingius]; [https://www.geni.com/profil
