1 NAME Tobias /Mac-Dougall/
2 GIVN Tobias
2 SURN Mac-Dougall
2 _MARNM Duwall
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1600
1 DEAT
2 DATE AFT 1657
