2 CONT Madame. Born 1713-04-19 in Gamleby (H). Baptized 1713-04-22 in Gamleby (H). Baptism witnesses: Lived 1738 in Winäs Säteri, Västra Ed (H). Lived 1748 in Djursnäs, Västra Ed (H). Lived 1755 in Gamleby (H). Lived 1764 in Gunnerstad, 
