1 NAME Carl Berndt Gustafsson // till Haga
2 GIVN Carl Berndt Gustafsson
2 SURN Uggla
2 NSFX till Haga
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1699
2 PLAC Hakoinen
2 ADDR
3 CITY Janakkala
3 CTRY Finland
1 DEAT
2 DATE 11 JUL 1771
2 PLAC Rehakka
2 ADDR
