1 NOTE !Information compiled in 1985 by Olof Barkman, Enskede, Sweden for Elin Barkman
2 CONT Ashenhurst, Colorado Springs, Co.
2 CONT Information came from the Royal Library, Stockholm, Sweden, Slakt och Havd 1972-1973 p. 380 Visingo Skolas Matrikel
2 CONT In the cathedral at Vaxjo, nr:241 (Vadstena Lan Arkivet) Goran Berchman requested an available stipend to his both sons, the year before enrolled in school in 1694.  He wrote ..."left with no resources after my late wife Elisabeth
2 CONC  Ericksdotter Retzia..."
2 CONT Enrolled in the Bahe school in Visingo Matrikel (enrollment) 1636-1816  in the year 1694:  Ericus Gabriel Berchman (major, mortus 1748)
2 CONT Johannes Berchman (mortus, anno 1698 in Feb)
2 CONT
2 CONT !Olof thinks this Johannes is our Johan.  He says spelling was not so important in those years.
2 CONT
2 CONT Baptism also done in Las Vegas Temple 19 Dec 1998  I didn't know Blaine Beckstrand had already done it.
1 NOTE Göran Berchman, född i sept 1647, död 3/10 1717 i Kabbarp, Gränna. Major. Namnet stavas omväxlande Berchman/Barchman/Barkman. 
2 CONT Sergeant 1677 boende i Ingatorps socken. Löjtnant 1682, kapten 
2 CONT 1685, major 1700. Jöran deltog bl.a i slaget vid Lund 1676. 
2 CONT Död 3/10 1717 i Kabbarp, Gränna och begravd den 11/10. 
2 CONT Jöran låg begraven i Gränna kyrka med gravsten och epitafier, men 
2 CONT detta förstördes dock när kyrkan brann 28 jan 1889. 
1 NOTE Gift första gången med Elisabet Retzia, dotter till kyrkoherde 
2 CONT Erik Retzius och hustru Karin Jönsdotter, Rumskulla. De bosätter sig 1683 i Torrsjö, Flisby hos svärmoderns andra make: kyrkoherde Laurentius Wallenius. Jörans namnteckning finns bevarad i ett kyrkodokument från Flisby 27 ap
2 CONC ril 1689. 
1 NOTE Gift andra gången ca 1690 med Elsa Edman; (se nästa ana). Familjen flyttade 1692 till Kabbarp, Gränna. Göran får där några hemman; 1/2 kronohemman Knukebo och 1/2 hemman Ingfrearp som donation på "behagelig tid". 
1 NOTE 1712 gifter han sig för tredje gången med Christina Juliana 
2 CONT Lejondahl, född 1680 i Aranäs, dotter till Hans Lejondahl. 
1 CHAN
2 DATE 04 MAR 2022
3 TIME 10:17:16
